Hi <%= @application.user.full_name %>,

<% case @application.status %>
<% when "shortlisted" %>
Good news: the host of <%= @listing.title %> shortlisted your application.
They will propose a visit soon, so keep an eye on your application.
<% when "accepted" %>
Congratulations! Your application for <%= @listing.title %> was accepted.
The room is now reserved for you: get in touch with the host to arrange your
move-in on <%= l(@application.desired_move_in_date, format: :long) %>.
<% when "rejected" %>
The host of <%= @listing.title %> chose another applicant this time.
Thank you for applying. There are more rooms waiting for you on Roomies.
<% end %>

See your application: <%= application_url(@application) %>
